Section: 3.1 Candidate Table Retrieval
Text: 3.1 Candidate Table Retrieval Candidate table retrieval aims to get a small can- didate table set from the whole table set of large scale, which is hundreds of thousands in our ex- periment. In order to guarantee the efﬁciency of the searching process, we calculate the similar- ity between table and query with Okapi BM25 (Robertson et al., 1995), which is computation- ally efﬁcient and has been successfully used in in- formation retrieval.

