Page: 4
Section: 4.2 Matching with Neural Networks
Text: We use recurrent neural net- work (RNN) to map a query of variable length to a ﬁxed-length vector. To avoid the problem of gradi- ent vanishing, we use gated recurrent unit (GRU) (Cho et al., 2014) as the basic computation unit, which adaptively forgets the history and remem- bers the input, and has proven to be effective in sequence modeling (Chung et al., 2014).

